{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "25a80e979d1474c5685655830ce16b1ba29c579078b8dcc0a216680ffdbdaf14", "ja": "（『SHADE OF SPADE』による演劇が、\n千秋楽を終えた。みんな、本当にいい演技だったぞ！）", "zh": "（《SHADE OF SPADE》的演剧已经结束最终场了。大家真的都演得很好啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "02d73ed1a92f591fce84633d1ff22dfe9b3fa9b316ba886ee36a9528d81d117b", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、{$P$}！　ちょっといい？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}！方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ade859393940ed5d4880862883ac451232269dc5ce4e2e9348c21836320f1dc0", "ja": "あれっ？　美希。まだ着替えてないのか？", "zh": "咦？美希，你还没换衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "607ad008ad73f324d6fe0fa2e4cad0868961b1c84f60dbbb26ad3f5bca918992", "ja": "うん、着替える前に、聞きたい事思い出したから。\nねぇねぇ、今回、誰がいちばんカッコよかった？", "zh": "嗯，在换衣服之前，美希想起有件事想问。\n我说我说，这次谁最帅呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1004_p", "source_sha256": "090587c1783a5f83c9ad207cfa79170464c5428aea50da573e83796cb8fb1631", "ja": "え？　誰が、か……それぞれ違うタイプの\n悪役だったからな。一番っていうのは難しいな。", "zh": "诶？要说谁最帅啊……因为每个人演的都是不同类型的反派。要选第一名还真有点难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "f36e411819ee75147b73c0a8b893a9437338f4990d8c32b7fc5bee2d85521ebb", "ja": "ブーッ！　不正解なの。", "zh": "嘟——！回答错误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d3f968ef57834f2d8871c698b330d956bb75093ba6eb9a6606599daa478444e2", "ja": "えっ、感想に正解とか不正解とかあるのか……。", "zh": "诶，感想还有正确和错误之分吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "adcaf744f97567fc3d1cd6229c74eadb7a2f7985b2a5c276356865ac5658fd3a", "ja": "あーあ、なんかミキ、ちょっと眠くなってきちゃった。\nハニー、おんぶしてなの。", "zh": "啊——美希好像有点困了。\n亲爱的，背我嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4018993301f3d124d6b49930b27c5dd3b123914e26b4e6a6b6151b25585a49f3", "ja": "えっ、いきなり……！？\nステージの片づけとかあるから、ちょっと今は……。", "zh": "诶，怎么突然……！？\n还要收拾舞台什么的，所以现在还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "69a6fd31f4681edd2c1e611c003fb98b02ed214f267a36b015135dfc063c7c05", "ja": "むー……ハニーのけちんぼ！\nミキ、すっごくすっごくすっごく頑張ったのに！", "zh": "唔……哈尼真小气！\n美希明明已经非常非常非常努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "2bc4c9b4d7ab907cd136842c9e7dd6a756c67a205cf007f0f2d41314cd3cf4e6", "ja": "もういいの。ミキ、今日からお仕事サボっちゃうの。\n褒めてくれるまで、頑張りませーんなの！", "zh": "算了。美希从今天开始就要翘掉工作。\n在夸我之前，我才不要努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1011_p", "source_sha256": "00b8cdc0be85f2144b760aaaa5b0520ad7433549ff06ef94c094cb79f277823b", "ja": "え？　あれ……褒めてなかったっけ？", "zh": "诶？奇怪……我不是已经夸过你了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "18ce6aded5cb1ebc927e5662b5d06b1f877b75a57a3d2777cd53fb3b7d074b55", "ja": "ぜんぜん褒めてないの！　ニヤニヤしながら拍手して、\n心の中で「いい演技だったぞ！」って言っただけなの。", "zh": "我完全没在夸你！只是笑眯眯地拍着手，在心里说了句“演得不错嘛！”而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c50f473cd9bef6828be63816ec42caff2ecd7fed9328070d3725a5dbdbccc120", "ja": "心の声がわかってるなら、もうそれでいいんじゃ……。\nいや、声に出してないのは、悪かったよな……ゴホン。", "zh": "既然都听到心声了，那不就已经可以了嘛……\n不对，没直接说出口确实是我不好……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "257a37dec6146a3c131b8a2843888ba6f882442417445e383a0997c290f4fbe7", "ja": "じー……。", "zh": "（盯）…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fa63ca44a17d81ec0d878c746b3366a4c2384be4b1c258dbf22402013013cc1d", "ja": "ええと……美希、最高にいい演技だったよ。\nすごくカッコよくて、目が離せなかった。本当に。", "zh": "那个……美希，你刚才的演技实在太棒了。\n帅气得让人完全移不开视线。真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "aa9eef49f6d355c9fc6a4bad4ed1dc320ff0a3be6d32a8a7ca52eaa8b961a71f", "ja": "んー、ちょっと普通だけど……。\n真剣なところがよかったの！　65点かな。", "zh": "嗯～虽然稍微普通了点……\n但态度很认真，这点很棒！给65分吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1017_p", "source_sha256": "73f50c6d0e41de72005ae22e0c433875e888bdcdc9f6fede59c93658ed200352", "ja": "辛口評価だな……まあ、ありがとう。", "zh": "评价真够犀利的……不过，谢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "8cf1cb557657d84e192f71c982e5fa1b11a2d0cca0d954b79d67150ffb31e140", "ja": "でも、ミキいっぱい悲しかったし……今夜は\n打ち上げデートね？　お店の予約、よろしくなの～。", "zh": "不过，美希真的很伤心……所以今晚就来一场庆功约会吧？店就拜托你预订啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "708bfb441e00f326725a25777a1f3591ecc7eb0d464e5d8cdd0e5288990ddf3c", "ja": "それじゃ、着替えてくるね。他の子とのヤクソク、\n作っちゃヤだよ？　なんてね、あはっ☆", "zh": "那我去换衣服啦。可不许和其他女孩子约定什么的哦？开玩笑的，啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0303_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5b6de3d7d81888acb838276c03fa845d64af450f215510c274a8ab7e0bad62d0", "ja": "（やれやれ、断りづらい流れを作られてしまった。\n計画的な作戦か？　恐るべし美希、だな……！）", "zh": "（真是的，被她营造出了一个让人难以拒绝的局面。是计划好的策略吗？美希真可怕啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
